 "rites_of_war": [
  {
   "id": "codex/renegades_and_heretics/rites_of_war/lost_and_the_damned",
   "name": "Lost & the Damned",
   "page": 25,
   "url": "https://longwarindex.app/rites_of_war/lost_and_the_damned/",
   "offered_by": {
    "codex": "renegades_and_heretics"
   },
   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- Your army must include at least 1 Dark Master.\n- Your army must include at least 2 Cultist Mobs.\n- Your army must include more Infantry than Vehicle units.\n\nBenefit\n\n- At the start of the battle, during the deployment step, you can select 1 Cultist Mob unit to be Marked for Sacrifice. When the last model in the unit would be slain and removed from play, summon 1 Bloodletter, Daemonette, Plaguebearer or Pink Horror unit within 12\" of the marked unit, more than 3\" away from any enemy models. After the chosen unit is slain, you may select another unit to be Marked for sacrifice.\n- Cultist Mob units in your army may purchase:\n    - Blasting Charges for 10pts for the whole unit.\n    - Frag Grenades for 5pts for the whole unit.\n- You may field 1 Accursed Cultist unit in your army without taking a Force Organization Slot for each Cultist Mob unit in your army.",
