  {
   "id": "codex/renegades_and_heretics/rites_of_war/cult_of_the_arkifane",
   "name": "Cult of the Arkifane",
   "page": 26,
   "url": "https://longwarindex.app/rites_of_war/cult_of_the_arkifane/",
   "offered_by": {
    "codex": "renegades_and_heretics"
   },
   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- If your army includes Vashtorr the Arkifane, he must be your Warlord.\n- You may not include any units with Marks of Chaos except for the Mark of Chaos Undivided.\n- Your army may not include more Vehicle type units than it does Infantry type units.\n\nBenefit\n\n- You may include Fiend Packs from Codex – Chaos Space Marines as Elites choices in your primary detachment.\n- You may field Soul Grinders as Troops choices. These may not be your compulsory units.\n- You gain access to Vashtorr the Arkifane (see below).",
